  "body": "Welcome to The Victor – the best in modern architecture and award-winning contemporary design. This stunning north-facing apartment offers the pinnacle of coastal living without comparison.\r\n\r\nStep off the beach and enter a different world, where the full height ‘living’ atrium is criss-crossed by sky bridges above, providing an impressive front of house access. Secure Keyless entry at every stage of your entrance elevates the hotel feel of the apartment. Every space has been thoughtfully created to maximise and allow natural light all the way to the north-facing balcony.\r\n\r\nThe open plan lounge, kitchen and dining area is the main entertaining area with high ceilings. The master bedroom captures the sun and has access to the floor level balcony with floating tiles. Every aspect has been designed for comfort and style. The walk-in wardrobe and fully tiled ensuite bathroom are effortless.\r\n\r\nThe spacious second bedroom is located away for privacy and enjoys the second bathroom. Storage cupboards and spaces are throughout and a closed off and ducted laundry room.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen includes an induction hob and oven with a matching single draw dishwasher. The peninsula bench conceals push-door cupboards for extra items. There is space and a lockable storage cupboard in the secure underground carpark with direct lift access.\r\n\r\nWhen you need to entertain with more guests, you could utilise the residents’ private lounge and play a few games of pool. These beautifully landscaped communal areas are ideal for relaxing or connecting with neighbours.\r\n\r\nDesigned with lifestyle in mind, these apartments are more than just a home – they’re a retreat.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of Browns Bay village, just steps away from the library, cafés, restaurants, and shops that create a vibrant community atmosphere. With the pristine beach on your doorstep, every day feels like a holiday, so call now for a tour of your new home!",
